        "Content": "Detached period Residence\r\n\r\n0.70 acre site with development potential (subject to planning)\r\n\r\nApprox 659 sq m of accommodation\r\n\r\nExtensive mature gardens\r\n\r\nLarge reception spaces\r\n\r\nExtensive private off-street parking\r\n\r\nPrestigious Dublin 6 address"
